# mrinspect-fixture: source=2aad056 kind=logic

commit 2aad0565d5509c44051c88fca4e81f3d6cd0edb0
Author: tw.johnwu <tw.johnwu@gmail.com>
Date:   Sat Aug 29 23:05:20 2026 +0800

    fix(reviewer): cut response at earliest marker across all markers, not list priority (U1)
    
    List-priority selection let a marker string quoted inside the reviewed
    diff near the response tail hijack the cut and discard the whole real
    review. Earliest-position selection keeps the review; an echoed marker
    before real content now merely keeps visible noise that validation
    still gates. Fixed in both the Go reviewer and the TS runner, with
    regression tests on both sides (fail-then-pass).

